# Source precedence

Read `docs/control/CURRENT_SOURCE_MANIFEST.md` and `docs/control/SUPERSESSION_REGISTER.md`.

Use this order:

1. accepted executed evidence;
2. accepted owner decisions, ADRs, gates and producer contracts;
3. exact repository reality;
4. current integrated system documentation and source manifest;
5. official current technical documentation;
6. historical/community sources.

Do not choose a source only because it has a newer timestamp. When sources conflict, name both exact locations, stop the affected path and request the owner/shared alignment resolution.